  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/01/IMG_4425.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>La noche del Rosc&oacute;n de Reyes ha cerrado el ciclo de fiestas navide&ntilde;as, en Onda con gran animaci&oacute;n, con cenas como la de Les Tasques en la Font de Dins, seguida de un inteso y duradero karaoke, y con la actuaci&oacute;n estelar en el pabell&oacute;n V&iacute;ctor Cabedo Carda de la orquesta Supermagic, que mantuvo la marcha hasta pasadas las 7 de la ma&ntilde;ana.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tortellreisonda/img_4395.jpg\" alt=\"img_4395\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tortellreisonda/img_4397.jpg\" alt=\"img_4397\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tortellreisonda/img_4398.jpg\" alt=\"img_4398\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tortellreisonda/img_4399.jpg\" alt=\"img_4399\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tortellreisonda/img_4400.jpg\" alt=\"img_4400\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tortellreisonda/img_4401.jpg\" alt=\"img_4401\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tortellreisonda/img_4402.jpg\" alt=\"img_4402\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tortellreisonda/img_4403.jpg\" alt=\"img_4403\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tortellreisonda/img_4405.jpg\" alt=\"img_4405\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /